  "notes": "Light for «تاب», stars for the heavens, geometric for «قدير». No people. STAGING v4: 39: one man in a prayer hall for whoever repents after his wrong (after his theft, Al-Muyassar): he lowers his head on 39:2 with the light plate (repenting), raises his hands on 39:4, prays on 39:6 (reforming his deeds) and prostrates on 39:9; he sits, stands and leaves on 39:14, before the address of 40:1, so no lone man is in frame then. 40: the empty hall with the camera, stars for the heavens and the earth, geometric for the closing name."
